[3.002339, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m## 2. Follow-up — history over threshold triggers compaction\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[1.502517, "o", "The client sends ONLY previous_response_id plus a compaction\r\nblock (compact_threshold=1000). Praxis rehydrates the stored\r\nhistory; because it exceeds the threshold, the compact filter\r\nsummarizes the prior turns via an inference callout, then forwards\r\nonly the summary + the current question.\r\n"]
